    "Stowaway-01": "偷渡者-01",
    "The very first. Simple, fun, sharp.": "最初的那一个。简单、有趣、锋利。",
    "Percussive maintenance.": "用敲打来维护。",
    "Wood for the bruise, nails for the follow-up.": "木头留下淤青，钉子负责追加。",
    "Extreme game of Hot Potato.": "极限版烫手山芋。",
    "Prettier and deadlier than your average grenade.": "比普通手榴弹更漂亮，也更致命。",
    "A network of fun.": "一张乐趣之网。",
    "Up up and away.": "向上，向上，飞走。",
    "Looks like food. ~Murray doesn't know the difference~.": "看起来像食物。~默里分不出来~。",
    "I'm sure the slice of pizza from another dimension is fine to eat.": "我确定来自另一个维度的披萨片完全可以吃。",
    "One shot at a time. More than enough to get the job done.": "一次一枪。完成任务绰绰有余。",
    "Fire lead for as long as you'd like.": "想打多久铅弹就打多久。",
    "Pistol, but some more.": "手枪，但更多一些。",
    "Subpar bullet quality.": "子弹质量一般。",
    "Unreliable, but does enough to make up for it.": "不太可靠，但威力足以弥补。",
    "Congratulations.": "恭喜。",
    "For when throwing felt too personal.": "当投掷显得太私人时使用。",
    "Granule-style chiropractic adjustment.": "Granule 风格的正骨调整。",
    "A highly focused beam of light. It has no regard for organic matter.": "高度聚焦的光束。它不在乎有机物。",
    "Throw it and watch it come back with more blood than it left with.": "扔出去，看它带着比出发时更多的血回来。",
    "Murray isn't much of a dancer, but you can make him one.": "默里不太会跳舞，但你可以让他跳。",
    "You only have to start it. It handles the rest.": "你只需要启动它。剩下的它自己处理。",
    "Numbs the pain long enough to cause some more.": "把疼痛麻痹到足以再制造一些疼痛。",
    "The source of all life, although life is ~not very common~ in The Granule.": "一切生命的源泉，尽管生命在 The Granule 中 ~并不常见~。",
    "Separate some parts of Murray from other parts of Murray.": "把默里的某些部分和默里的其他部分分开。",
    "Heals almost anything you can throw at our friend. The memories and feelings of events ~are removed~.": "几乎能治好你对我们朋友做的一切。事件的记忆和感受 ~会被移除~。",
    "Turn useless flesh into adorably scientific horrors. ~Unappetizing~.": "把无用的血肉变成可爱又科学的恐怖产物。~毫无食欲~。",
    "Always remember to keep your Murray charged.": "永远记得让你的默里保持充能。",
    "There's always something to celebrate.": "总有值得庆祝的事。",
    "Ties things to other things. Pulls, hangs, and restrains.": "把东西绑到别的东西上。拉、吊、束缚。",
    "We won't be needing this.": "我们不再需要这个了。",
    "Have some crabs.": "来点螃蟹。",
    "They like him warm.": "它们喜欢他暖和。",
    "Enough of them and he finally gets to fly.": "足够多的话，他终于能飞起来。",
    "Murray's favorite way to fly.": "默里最喜欢的飞行方式。",
    "The #1 rule of playing with the fabric of space is to have fun. ~Stable~.": "玩弄空间结构的头号规则就是玩得开心。~稳定~。",
    "A truly singular experience.": "真正独一无二的体验。",
    "Nothing here yet - more to come.": "这里还没有内容——更多内容即将到来。",
